---
import { apldContractedRent, apldReported } from '../data/apld-valuation';
interface Props { variant: 'business' | 'revenue' | 'delivery' | 'claims'; language?: 'ko' | 'en' }
const { variant, language = 'ko' } = Astro.props;
const ko = language === 'ko';
const rentMax = Math.max(...apldContractedRent.map((row) => row.rent));
---
<figure class="apld-figure">
  {variant === 'business' && <><h3>{ko ? '계약에서 보통주까지, 다섯 번의 전환' : 'Five conversions between a contract and common equity'}</h3><div class="flow"><span>1.41GW<br/><small>{ko ? '계약 MW' : 'Contracted MW'}</small></span><i>→</i><span>{ko ? '가동 MW' : 'Operational MW'}</span><i>→</i><span>{ko ? '기본 임대료' : 'Base rent'}</span><i>→</i><span>NOI</span><i>→</i><span>{ko ? '보통주 잔여가치' : 'Common equity'}</span></div><figcaption>{ko ? '계약 체결은 첫 단계다. 건설·인도·자본청구권을 지난 현금만 보통주주에게 남는다.' : 'A signed contract is the first step. Only cash after construction, delivery, and capital claims reaches common equity.'}</figcaption></>}
  {variant === 'revenue' && <><h3>{ko ? 'Q1 매출의 크기와 반복성은 다르다' : 'Q1 revenue size is not the same as recurrence'}</h3><div class="stack"><div style={`--w:${apldReported.tenantBuildServices / apldReported.q1Revenue * 100}%`}><b>{ko ? '구축 서비스' : 'Tenant build services'}</b><span>$183.5M</span></div><div style={`--w:${apldReported.baseRent / apldReported.q1Revenue * 100}%`} class="rent"><b>{ko ? '기본 임대료' : 'Base rent'}</b><span>$65.8M</span></div><div style={`--w:${apldReported.tenantRecoveries / apldReported.q1Revenue * 100}%`}><b>{ko ? '비용 회수' : 'Recoveries'}</b><span>$13.3M</span></div></div><figcaption>{ko ? '연결 매출 $341.9M 중 기본 임대료가 반복 임대 경제성의 출발점이다. 남은 연결 사업·조정 항목도 같은 임대료로 읽지 않는다.' : 'Of $341.9M consolidated revenue, base rent is the starting point for recurring lease economics. Other businesses and adjustments do not share its character.'}</figcaption></>}
  {variant === 'delivery' && <><h3>{ko ? '임대료 가시성은 높지만, 인도 속도가 경로를 결정한다' : 'Rent visibility is high; delivery sets the path'}</h3><div class="rent-bars">{apldContractedRent.map(row => <div><span>{row.year}</span><i style={`height:${row.rent / rentMax * 100}%`}></i><b>${(row.rent / 1000).toFixed(2)}B</b></div>)}</div><p class="delivery-note">{ko ? 'Polaris Forge 1: 2026년 10월 250MW 인도. 나머지 계약 용량의 실제 인도일과 임대 개시일은 별도로 추적해야 한다.' : 'Polaris Forge 1: 250MW delivered by October 2026. Track actual delivery and rent commencement separately for the remaining contracted capacity.'}</p><figcaption>{ko ? 'FY2032 이후 Thereafter 금액은 공시 총액일 뿐, 이 그림은 임의로 연도별로 나누지 않았다.' : 'The thereafter amount is a disclosed aggregate; this figure does not invent an annual allocation after FY2031.'}</figcaption></>}
  {variant === 'claims' && <><h3>{ko ? '높은 NOI에서 보통주까지의 거리' : 'The distance from high NOI to common equity'}</h3><div class="claims"><div class="source">{ko ? '기본 임대료' : 'Base rent'}<b>$65.8M</b></div><div>− {ko ? '부동산 운영비' : 'Property opex'}</div><div class="source">NOI<b>$58.8M</b></div><div>− {ko ? '본사 비용·유지 CAPEX·세금' : 'Corporate cost, maintenance CAPEX, taxes'}</div><div>− {ko ? '개발 CAPEX·부채·우선/NCI 청구권' : 'Development CAPEX, debt, preferred/NCI claims'}</div><div class="common">= {ko ? '보통주 잔여현금흐름' : 'Residual common cash flow'}</div></div><figcaption>{ko ? '마지막 상자는 공시 숫자가 아니라 계산의 목적이다. 프로젝트별 현금배분을 확인하기 전에는 크기를 단정할 수 없다.' : 'The last box is the object of the calculation, not a reported figure. Its size remains uncertain without project-level cash distributions.'}</figcaption></>}
</figure>
<style>
  .apld-figure{margin:2.2rem 0;padding:1.1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-deep);font-size:.88rem}.apld-figure h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;margin:0 0 .8rem}.apld-figure figcaption{margin-top:.8rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem}.flow{display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:.35rem;overflow:auto;padding-bottom:.2rem}.flow span{min-width:100px;padding:.7rem;background:var(--paper);border-left:3px solid var(--accent);font-weight:700}.flow small{font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)}.flow i{align-self:center;font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)}.stack{display:grid;gap:.5rem}.stack div{width:max(32%,var(--w));display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding:.55rem .7rem;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 14%,var(--paper));border-left:3px solid var(--accent)}.stack .rent{background:color-mix(in srgb,#34799f 22%,var(--paper));border-color:#34799f}.rent-bars{height:155px;display:flex;gap:.7rem;align-items:end;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.rent-bars>div{height:100%;display:grid;grid-template-rows:1fr auto auto;align-items:end;gap:.25rem;flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:.75rem}.rent-bars i{display:block;width:100%;background:var(--accent);min-height:4px}.rent-bars b{font-size:.72rem}.delivery-note{padding:.6rem;background:var(--paper);font-size:.8rem}.claims{display:grid;gap:.35rem}.claims>div{padding:.6rem .75rem;background:var(--paper);border-left:3px solid var(--line)}.claims .source{border-color:var(--accent);display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.claims .common{border-color:#34799f;background:color-mix(in srgb,#34799f 12%,var(--paper));font-weight:700}@media(max-width:600px){.apld-figure{padding:.85rem}.flow{gap:.25rem}.flow span{min-width:90px;font-size:.8rem}.stack div{width:100%;font-size:.8rem}.rent-bars{gap:.35rem}.rent-bars b{font-size:.65rem}}
</style>
